From: Guo Jie <guojie@loongson.cn>
Date: Mon, 30 Dec 2024 10:34:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/59] LoongArch: Remove useless UNSPECs and define_mode_attrs

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* config/loongarch/lasx.md: Remove useless code.
	* config/loongarch/lsx.md: Ditto.
---
 gcc/config/loongarch/lasx.md | 66 ------------------------------------
 gcc/config/loongarch/lsx.md  | 35 -------------------
 2 files changed, 101 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gcc/config/loongarch/lasx.md b/gcc/config/loongarch/lasx.md
index a4505dcbd..d80791067 100644
--- a/src/gcc/config/loongarch/lasx.md
+++ b/src/gcc/config/loongarch/lasx.md
@@ -37,16 +37,12 @@
   UNSPEC_LASX_XVFCVTH
